 "applies_to": "Weil-McLain boilers with the Unity 2 control (ECO Tec 80/110/150/199 wall-mount and combi, SVF 500/600), per Modbus supplement 550-100-266/1023.",
 "summary": "Weil-McLain's Unity 2 boiler control has a built-in Modbus RTU slave on the BMS terminals of J12 (a plug-in harness on ECO Tec, pre-installed board on SVF). This map covers the supplement's 'frequently used points': model, boiler state, active priority, blower speed and modulation, flame signal, all temperature sensors in degrees F, DHW flow, gas valve and 120 V output status, and gas type.",
